{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37788","headline":"兵部卢郎中光济借示诗集以四韵谢之 · 郑谷","name":"兵部卢郎中光济借示诗集以四韵谢之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"七子风骚寻失主，五君歌诵久无声。\n调和雅乐归时正，澄滤颓波到底清。\n才大始知寰宇窄，吟高何止鬼神惊。\n叶公好尚浑疎阔，忽见真龙几丧明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37788.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37788","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}